The prediction at slide level of MoE-CNN_simple variant was aggregated from the 75th percentile of tile-level prediction. The final prediction for each WSI using the MoE-CNN_CLAM and MoE-UNI_CLAM variants was obtained via a weighted average approach (Eqs. 3, 4 & 5).
